  "notes": "Cash basis county. Statement receipts/disbursements from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Taxes 6,364,960 split per the Statement of Activities general receipts (p2): Property tax 5,914,827 + Other taxes 450,133. Roll-forward on fund balances 8,538,307 -> 8,553,200 (ties); ending cash = Cash and cash equivalents (p3); no beginning cash printed. Balance sheet from the governmental funds statement Total column (equals the Statement of Net Position). Detail from the budget-and-actual schedules of every fund (pp5-23); the nonmajor combining schedule (pp24-25) is not recorded, since each nonmajor fund has its own (more detailed) budget schedule that ties to its column. Lines with a budget but no actual (Road and Bridge equipment rental budget 13,500; Highway Bridge Buyback operating budget 212,592; County Fair Sinking operating budget 27,466; Inheritance Tax Fund operating budget 1,841,626; Keno Reserve operating budget 50,746) and the empty Road Sinking Fund schedule are not recorded. The General Fund budget schedule prints the 507,695 group under 'Public Works' and the 100,810 group under 'Public Health and Welfare', while the fund statement (p4) and Statement of Activities show them as Public Health and Welfare and Culture and Recreation; departments kept as printed, categories follow the statement (review). Read pages 1-25 of 25",
